 their wealth and their lives. Those will have [all that is] good and it is those who are the successful.","j":10,"h":20,"s":9,"a":88,"sd":null},{"k":"9:89","t":"Allāh has prepared for them gardens beneath which rivers flow, wherein they will abide eternally. That is the great attainment.","j":10,"h":20,"s":9,"a":89,"sd":null},{"k":"9:90","t":"And those with excuses among the bedouins came to be permitted [to remain], and they who had lied to Allāh and His Messenger sat [at home]. There will strike those who disbelieved among them a painful punishment.","j":10,"h":20,"s":9,"a":90,"sd":null},{"k":"9:91","t":"There is not upon the weak or upon the ill or upon those who do not find anything to spend any discomfort [i.e., guilt] when they are sincere to Allāh and His Messenger. There is not upon the doers of good any cause [for blame]. And Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful.","j":10,"h":20,"s":9,"a":91,"sd":null},{"k":"9:92","t":"Nor [is there blame] upon those who, when they came to you for you to take them along, you said, \"I can find nothing upon which to carry you.\" They turned back while their eyes overflowed with tears out of grief that they could not find something to spend [for the cause of Allāh].","j":10,"h":20,"s":9,"a":92,"sd":null},{"k":"9:93","t":"The cause [for blame] is only upon those who ask permission of you while they are rich. They are satisfied to be with those who stay behind, and Allāh has sealed over their hearts, so they do not know.","j":11,"h":21,"s":9,"a":93,"sd":null}],"juz":10,"hizb":20,"surahs":[9],"sajdah":false}